== case inline/names-bad
errors 2
error BYN3102: `name` must be a string `namespace/name` of lowercase words joined by `-`, e.g.
`"local/tally"`
  1 │ Package { name: "a/b/c", version: "01.2.3" }
    │                 ^^^^^^^
error BYN3102: `version` must be a semantic version string, e.g. `"0.1.0"`
  1 │ Package { name: "a/b/c", version: "01.2.3" }
    │                                   ^^^^^^^^
